# API & auth

- Use Orval-generated clients on a shared Axios instance.
- Prefer Orval types for request/response contracts.
- Hand-write types only for props, lib/utils, and non-API code.
- Read auth token from cookie; send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
- Centralize API error mapping in `lib` (status → user message + logging).
- UX baseline: error boundaries, toasts, inline field errors, Suspense/skeletons, mutation error states.

```ts
// ✅ Axios interceptor sketch
api.interceptors.request.use((config) => {
  const token = getTokenFromCookie();
  if (token) config.headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;
  return config;
});
```
